# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`.
#
# Only bulk-formatting commits belong here — changes that touch many lines
# without changing behaviour, and which would otherwise make every line in the
# repo blame to a formatting pass instead of the commit that wrote the logic.
#
# Enable it locally (once per clone):
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads this file automatically. `git blame --ignore-revs-file` works
# without the config if you prefer to pass it per invocation.

